<title>BELGIUM: U.S. Fina's Texas unit expands in HDPE.</title>
<headline>U.S. Fina's Texas unit expands in HDPE.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. Fina Inc, a unit of Belgian oil group PetroFina, said in a statement on Tuesday it finalised plans for expansion of its high density polyethylene (HDPE) facility in Bayport, Texas.</p>
<p>Fina said the new production unit, which will be completed in mid-1998, will nearly double Fina's annual HDPE capacity to 385,000 tonnes from the current level of 190,000 tonnes.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
